{"id":"proniknut_","lemma":"проникнуть","pos":"verb","rank":2194,"glosses":["to penetrate","to permeate","to infiltrate"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ef/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%BD%D1%83%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%BD%D1%83%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"проникну","2s":"проникнешь","3s":"проникнет","1p":"проникнем","2p":"проникнете","3p":"проникнут"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"проникни","2p":"проникните"}}},"past":{"m":"проник","p":"проникли","f":"проникла","n":"проникло"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"проникать","examples":[{"text":"Я проник через окно.","en":"I came in through the window.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"through"},{"g":"window"}]},{"text":"Никто не мог проникнуть в здание.","en":"Nobody could get in the building.","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"building"}]},{"text":"Том проник в дом через окно.","en":"Tom entered the house through the window.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"window"}]},{"text":"Я не думал, что мы сможем туда проникнуть.","en":"I didn't think we'd be able to get in.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to be able, to manage","l":"смочь"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"Воры проникли в банк ночью.","en":"The burglars broke into the bank at night.","words":[{"g":"thief","l":"вор"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"bank"},{"g":"at night, by night"}]}]}